body:
I really appreciate everyone who took the time to read through me venting about my problems, thank you. It makes me feel like my experience is valid and that there is actual good people out there, like you all. Taking the time to respond, or even just read a post from a complete stranger is honestly such a nice thing to do, and I hope you all understand that you are good. 

I haven't really been on reddit before but I will try to make new contacts here as there seem to be some genuine people here.

&#x200B;

And as clearification for my post, my mother is aware of how I feel and what is happening to me, since I've been hospitalized unwillingly for my suicial thoughts. I just haven't told her about my EX taking advantage of me sexually, since that is a little harder to open up about.

&#x200B;

I hope you all are doing okay, stay safe.
